`ComplexSystem` represents a single complex system and has two properties: `name` and `components`. `name` is a string that identifies the system, and `components` is a list of components that make up the system.
`SystemSet` represents a set of complex systems and has one property: `systems`. `systems` is a list of `ComplexSystem` objects. The class also has several methods:
