- `remove_system`: removes a `ComplexSystem` object from the set.
- `get_system`: retrieves a `ComplexSystem` object from the set by name.
- `get_component_count`: returns the total number of components in all systems in the set.
- `compute_behavior`: computes the overall behavior of all systems in the set by summing the behavior of all components in all systems.
